README.md
    1→# MCPHost 🤖
    3→A CLI host application that enables Large Language Models (LLMs) to interact with external tools through the Model Context Protocol (MCP). Currently supports Claude, OpenAI, Google Gemini, and Ollama models.
    5→Discuss the Project on [Discord](https://discord.gg/RqSS2NQVsY)
    7→## Table of Contents
    9→- [Overview](#overview-)
    10→- [Features](#features-)
    11→- [Requirements](#requirements-)
    12→- [Environment Setup](#environment-setup-)
    13→- [Installation](#installation-)
    14→- [SDK Usage](#sdk-usage-)
    15→- [Configuration](#configuration-)
    16→  - [MCP Servers](#mcp-servers)
    17→  - [Environment Variable Substitution](#environment-variable-substitution)
    18→  - [Simplified Configuration Schema](#simplified-configuration-schema)
    19→  - [Tool Filtering](#tool-filtering)
    20→  - [Legacy Configuration Support](#legacy-configuration-support)
    21→  - [Transport Types](#transport-types)
    22→  - [System Prompt](#system-prompt)
    23→- [Usage](#usage-)
    24→  - [Interactive Mode](#interactive-mode-default)
    25→  - [Script Mode](#script-mode)
    26→  - [Hooks System](#hooks-system)
    27→  - [Non-Interactive Mode](#non-interactive-mode)
